 **Specialty**: A named field of veterinary practice that a Veterinarian holds. Relationships: A Specialty is held by zero or more Veterinarians. The seeded list is radiology, surgery, and dentistry. Avoid: Skill, Qualification, Discipline.
 
+**Narrowing** (decided 2026-08-23): A published list restricted to the members carrying one named value of an attribute the list already shows, presented otherwise unchanged. Relationships: The veterinarian directory is narrowed by Specialty; it is the only narrowing the clinic offers. Avoid: Filter, Filtering. **"Search" is a different concept, not a synonym.** A search takes text the reader types and looks for a record; a narrowing takes a whole attribute value the list already prints. Owner search is a search; the veterinarian directory is narrowed and is not searchable.
